---
import Layout from '../layouts/Win95Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Now — Prashant Garg" current="now">
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 pt-14 pb-20 space-y-5 text-base leading-relaxed">
    <h1 class="font-display text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4">Now</h1>
    <p>
      Cambridge, June 2026. Research Associate at the University of Cambridge
      (incoming postdoc at Bocconi from September 2026).
    </p>
    <p>
      Building the <span class="font-semibold">Global Automation Atlas</span> —
      mapping where automation is arriving across global production networks
      and what it displaces when it does.
    </p>
    <p>A handful of working papers are out on the seminar circuit right now:</p>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
      <li><a href="/research/causal-claims-economics" class="text-brand-red hover:underline">Causal Claims in Economics</a></li>
      <li><a href="/research/ai-production-networks" class="text-brand-red hover:underline">AI-Generated Production Networks</a></li>
      <li><a href="/research/platform-migration" class="text-brand-red hover:underline">Simple Contagion Drives Population-Scale Platform Migration</a></li>
      <li><a href="/research/health-shocks-research" class="text-brand-red hover:underline">(How) Do Health Shocks Reallocate Research Direction?</a></li>
    </ul>
    <p>Writing poetry on the backs of postcards.</p>
    <p class="text-sm text-ink/70 italic">Updated June 2026.</p>
  </article>
</Layout>
